{"id": "P0", "version": 2, "type": "purpose", "subject": "purpose", "owner": "AU-owner", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Let AI assistants carry real work between each other and across time (relay, capture, handoff, successor threads) without losing who said what, who authorized what, or where the work stands; it should save the owner attention, not create a second job of bookkeeping", "rationale": "Taken from governance/purpose.md L3-6 (the kit's own purpose statement; README.md L1-5 says the same). Provisional until Zach commits it; written by kai#telosmith-adoption under DEC-091 (relay-kit-private ledger)", "relations": [{"rel": "supersedes", "to": "P0@1"}], "anchors": [{"path": "governance/purpose.md", "locator": "L3-6", "for": "text", "sha256": "2f6d408242fc1f42379640deb802c9091a18eb0f4ae76ff3f27777c73ea094f6"}, {"path": "README.md", "locator": "L1-5", "for": "text", "sha256": "dcbe0c8aaf667ec506a00b2f6a299fb3385d347cceca64ad81e0fdbd7b18c31b"}]}
{"id": "RK-R-export", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "design", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "relay-kit/export@1: a read-only export of a records store, manifest.json (queried sources, counts, time bounds, hashes, filters, redaction policy, exclusions, coverage gaps) plus records.jsonl (one record per item with provenance and evidence_class); reads conversation@1 and handoff@1/@2 and changes neither", "rationale": "Contract registered in governance/contracts.json with spec docs/export.md and implementer tools/export.py; a contract changes only by a new version (ARCHITECTURE.md section 2)", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P0@2"}, {"rel": "implemented_by", "to": "code:tools.export"}], "anchors": [{"path": "governance/contracts.json", "locator": "q:\"id\": \"relay-kit/export@1\"", "for": "text", "sha256": "536b06fd7c3af590c62948d902326b84dd34a6bebbd41a46c17c8d5a46d9156b"}, {"path": "docs/export.md", "locator": "L1", "for": "text", "sha256": "1a0dba7ef6cc867d5b83f476fe2f38993434441039b6e0171359fa860093e62c"}]}
{"id": "RK-D-ledger", "version": 1, "type": "decision", "subject": "design", "status": "proposed", "text": "Pointer, not a decision made here: the owner decisions that govern this kit are kept in the relay-kit-private ledger (governance/decisions.jsonl): DEC-019 (information crosses freely, authority never crosses implicitly), DEC-035 (overlap warnings), DEC-037 (ledger append and old-format check), DEC-038 (review handoffs), DEC-042 (thread budget), DEC-057 (export), DEC-085 (Cockpit and MCP). That repository is private and is not readable from this public one, so these ids cannot be resolved or checked here. Records in this file are design truth inside the repo; the ledger carries cross-repo coordination and owner decisions. Status stays proposed until Zach accepts this record", "rationale": "DEC-091 (relay-kit-private ledger): each adopting repo's records cite the private ledger decisions that govern it", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P0@2"}]}
